From: =?utf-8?b?T25kxZllaiBTdXLDvQ==?= <ondrej@sury.org>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 15:22:15 +0100
Subject: Adjust the setlocale tests to glibc 2.41

glibc 2.39 and newer describe the en_US digit grouping with a single
element. Backport of upstream commit b6b9eab68e2 (PHP 8.2.20).
---
 .../tests/strings/setlocale_variation3.phpt        | 26 ++++++++--------------
 .../tests/strings/setlocale_variation4.phpt        | 26 ++++++++--------------
 .../tests/strings/setlocale_variation5.phpt        | 26 ++++++++--------------
 3 files changed, 27 insertions(+), 51 deletions(-)

